  m_Name: B7
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueStateSO
  <Texts>k__BackingField:
  - <Text>k__BackingField: <color=#99DDFF>I-I'm sorry, I don't understand... I have
      n-no idea what ritual... W-Who are...?
    TextAlignment: 260
  - <Text>k__BackingField: I feel shameful for my words failing on me in such a moment.
      The creature thankfully senses my discomfort, and extends her tail to nudge
      me closer.
    TextAlignment: 257
  - <Text>k__BackingField: <color=#FF99DD>Some explanations might clear off your
      apprehensions, little one.
    TextAlignment: 260
  - <Text>k__BackingField: She lifts her head and takes a more formal posture, perhaps
      more suitable of someone her stature.
    TextAlignment: 257
